{"id":"a77c8090d251f76a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modal-guarded-context.md","title":"方框保护的模态变量与单变量代入","display":"df-modal-guarded-context — 方框保护的模态变量与单变量代入","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modal-guarded-context","aliases":["72-df-modal-guarded-context"],"display":"df-modal-guarded-context — 方框保护的模态变量与单变量代入","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-substitution]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §4, Theorems 4.1–4.3, print484/PDF496; §2 notation print477/PDF489","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"structural recursion and source notation checked against page image","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modal-guarded-context"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modal-guarded-context</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-guarded-context — 方框保护的模态变量与单变量代入"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §4, Theorems 4.1–4.3, print484/PDF496; §2 notation print477/PDF489"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"structural recursion and source notation checked against page image"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a> 的自由语法树、变量支撑和同时代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_i\">\\(g_i\\)</span> 是按严格子树递归的布尔值函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[B/p_i]\">\\(A[B/p_i]\\)</span> 表示只代入指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>，其余指标保持原子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boxdot_m\">\\(\\boxdot_m\\)</span> 是下式引入的语法宏。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ng_i(p_j)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;i=j,\\\\1,&amp;i\\ne j,\\end{cases}&amp;g_i(\\bot_m)&amp;:=1,\\\\\ng_i(A\\to_m B)&amp;:=\\min\\{g_i(A),g_i(B)\\},&amp;g_i(\\Box_m A)&amp;:=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow g_i(A)=1,\\\\\n\\sigma_{i,B}(j)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}B,&amp;i=j,\\\\p_j,&amp;i\\ne j,\\end{cases}&amp;A[B/p_i]&amp;:=(\\sigma_{i,B})_m(A),\\\\\n\\boxdot_m A&amp;:=A\\land_m\\Box_m A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ng_i(p_j)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;i=j,\\\\1,&amp;i\\ne j,\\end{cases}&amp;g_i(\\bot_m)&amp;:=1,\\\\\ng_i(A\\to_m B)&amp;:=\\min\\{g_i(A),g_i(B)\\},&amp;g_i(\\Box_m A)&amp;:=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow g_i(A)=1,\\\\\n\\sigma_{i,B}(j)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}B,&amp;i=j,\\\\p_j,&amp;i\\ne j,\\end{cases}&amp;A[B/p_i]&amp;:=(\\sigma_{i,B})_m(A),\\\\\n\\boxdot_m A&amp;:=A\\land_m\\Box_m A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> 的出现都在某个方框之内，恰好由上述递归识别；不出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> 的公式也满足保护条件。原书在 p.477 将带中心标记的方框记号定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land\\Box A\">\\(A\\land\\Box A\\)</span>。p.484 唯一性定理使用这个记号，不能 OCR 成普通方框：普通方框版本在单点无边框架上立即失败。构造均按有限语法树递归，不引入绑定或捕获问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-substitution]] 的自由语法树、变量支撑和同时代入。$i,j\\in\\omega$，$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"g_i","display":false},{"tex":"A[B/p_i]","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\boxdot_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ng_i(p_j)&:=\\begin{cases}0,&i=j,\\\\1,&i\\ne j,\\end{cases}&g_i(\\bot_m)&:=1,\\\\\ng_i(A\\to_m B)&:=\\min\\{g_i(A),g_i(B)\\},&g_i(\\Box_m A)&:=1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Guard}_i(A)&:\\Longleftrightarrow g_i(A)=1,\\\\\n\\sigma_{i,B}(j)&:=\\begin{cases}B,&i=j,\\\\p_j,&i\\ne j,\\end{cases}&A[B/p_i]&:=(\\sigma_{i,B})_m(A),\\\\\n\\boxdot_m A&:=A\\land_m\\Box_m A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"A\\land\\Box A","display":false}],"bytes":1944,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"c782a953a5846737","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；语法、代入、$\\top_m,\\bot_m$ 和保护谓词取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]。$A_i,B$ 由下式构造；使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 的有限模型语义。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-538","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"5d05c1d542238d8c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$，代入及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i$ 取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 及有限模型完备性取 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。"},{"id":"e8c6112440a637e4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 与单变量代入取 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]；$\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 取 [[72-df-godel-lob-logic]]。"},{"id":"9eb88cb14d7f1646","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$；语法及 $\\operatorname{Guard}_i,\\boxdot_m$ 使用 [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]]，有限模型完备性使用 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]]。"}],"outgoing":["50496a022b75cf4f"]}